# Guitar, nylon-string (issue 047, from the second guitar photo): a classical guitar, same size and hanging as `guitar`. Pale cedar top, reddish mahogany sides, slotted headstock with black tuners, no pickguard or cutaway shading. A possible alternate or second guitar; not wired into the map.
size: 16x32
